  "description": "Since her mother’s death, Kang Ji-Yul has been living a listless life, shut away in her mansion. Then, Cha Seon-Tae, a former gangster, arrives at her mansion as the new gardener. With his cocky attitude, Seon-Tae mocks Ji-Yul as the “princess inside the castle” and gradually begins to disrupt her daily routine...\n\n *“Seeing you all worked up got me worked up too.”\n\n“I’m curious, aren’t I? I wonder what would happen if you really got turned on.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
